 * 
 * **Responsibilities:**
 * - Renders the main layout structure (Header, Main Workspace, Modals).
 * - Switches between "Main Workspace" (Editor/Nesting) and "Secondary Views" (Libraries/Setup) based on `mode`.
 * - Aggregates props and passes them down to specific sub-components (`Sidebar`, `CanvasArea`, etc.) to prevent prop drilling in the root file.
